## Qlippoth Entity Names & Descriptions

ent-QlippothBase = Qlippoth
    .desc = An anomalous entity from beyond dimensional boundaries.

ent-QlippothPhase1 = Minor Qlippoth
    .desc = A low-threat dimensional anomaly. Relatively docile but should be monitored.

ent-QlippothPhase2 = Verge Qlippoth
    .desc = An entity on the edge of anomaly threshold. Displays increasing energy signatures and unpredictable behavior.

ent-QlippothPhase3 = Eclipse Qlippoth
    .desc = A high-threat entity that emits mental interference patterns. Prolonged exposure causes sanity degradation.

ent-QlippothPhase4 = Abyss Qlippoth
    .desc = A severely dangerous entity radiating deep dimensional corruption. Capable of corrupting crew members in proximity.

ent-QlippothPhase5 = Horizon Qlippoth
    .desc = A cataclysmic-class entity capable of warping reality itself. Containment breach would be catastrophic.

